      "text": "Frequency once per day\n\n---\n\nEffect Jordus bites down on his tongue (taking 1 slashing damage), then exhales a 15-foot cone of burning smoke. Each creature in the area must attempt a DC 26 Reflex save save.\n\n---\n\nCritical Success The creature is unaffected.\n\nSuccess The creature takes 3d8 fire damage.\n\nFailure The creature takes 7d8 fire damage and is Sickened 1 by the agonizing pain of the burns.\n\nCritical Failure The creature takes 10d8 fire damage, is sickened 1 by the agonizing pain of the burns, and becomes cursed. The victim's burns never fully vanish, and the cursed creature takes a –2 status penalty to all attacks from the constant pain. Healing doesn't alter the appearance of the burns or lessen the penalty, but removing the curse does.\n\nEffect: Devil's Cursed Breath",
